with any new or revised financial accounting standards provided pursuant to Section 13(a) of the Exchange Act. <span id="xdx_90E_edei--EntityExTransitionPeriod_c20260818__20260818_zE0at3ezkXS"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2026-08-18" format="ixt:booleanfalse" id="Fact000032" name="dei:EntityExTransitionPeriod">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

